[heading]Installing the whole thing[/]
> [text]  This is not a single package but an ecosystem of components spread over many:
> the client, the server, the connectors and the rest are distributed separately.
> Installing tabsdata on its own gives you only a part of it.[/]

[text]  Install everything with[/]
[text]      [/][link] pip install tabsdata[/]
[text]    or[/][link] uv pip install tabsdata[/]
[text]  Or pin a version with[/]
[text]      [/][link] pip install "tabsdata==$pin"[/]
[text]    or[/][link] uv pip install "tabsdata==$pin"[/]

> [text]  If [term]tdk[/term], [term]tdkserver[/term] or any other component is missing, one of
> those packages is not installed. Under pyenv a freshly installed command can stay
> invisible until you run [term]pyenv rehash[/term].[/]
